## Tables Lacking Explicit Indexes
All 12 tables created via Schema::create() have explicit indexes (primary key + additional index() calls): - pivot_dept_cate_branches: indexes on department_id, category_id, branch_id - pivot_apoint_appraisals: indexes on evaluator_id, evaluatee_id, appraisal_category_id - pivot_category_appraisals: indexes on category_id, section_id - pivot_cross_backups: indexes on staff_id, backup_staff_id - pivot_leave_annuals: indexes on leave_id, leave_annual_id - pivot_leave_maternities: indexes on leave_id, leave_maternity_id - pivot_leave_mc: index on leave_id (plus quirk index on leave_mc_id named leave_annual_id) - pivot_leave_replacements: indexes on leave_id, leave_replacement_id - pivot_sales_job_description_get_items: indexes on sales_job_description_id, sales_get_item_id - pivot_sales_sales_delivery: indexes on sales_id, sales_delivery_id - pivot_staff_ci_category_item: indexes on staff_id, cicategory_item_id - pivot_staff_pivotdepts: indexes on staff_id, pivot_dept_id

## Foreign Keys Referencing Tables Created in Different Migration Files
All foreign keys referencing tables NOT created in this migration: 1. pivot_dept_cate_branches: department_id -> option_departments, category_id -> option_categories, branch_id -> option_branches 2. pivot_apoint_appraisals: evaluator_id -> staffs, evaluatee_id -> staffs, appraisal_category_id -> option_appraisal_categories 3. pivot_category_appraisals: category_id -> option_appraisal_categories, section_id -> hr_appraisal_sections 4. pivot_cross_backups: staff_id -> staffs, backup_staff_id -> staffs 5. pivot_leave_annuals: leave_id -> hr_leaves, leave_annual_id -> hr_leave_annuals 6. pivot_leave_maternities: leave_id -> hr_leaves, leave_maternity_id -> hr_leave_maternities 7. pivot_leave_mc: leave_id -> hr_leaves, leave_mc_id -> hr_leave_mc 8. pivot_leave_replacements: leave_id -> hr_leaves, leave_replacement_id -> hr_leave_replacements 9. pivot_sales_job_description_get_items: sales_job_description_id -> sales_job_descriptions, sales_get_item_id -> option_sales_get_items 10. pivot_staff_ci_category_item: staff_id -> staffs, cicategory_item_id -> ci_category_items 11. pivot_staff_pivotdepts: staff_id -> staffs (pivot_dept_id -> pivot_dept_cate_branches is SAME migration)

## Foreign Keys Referencing Tables in the Same Migration
- pivot_staff_pivotdepts: pivot_dept_id -> pivot_dept_cate_branches (both created in this migration) - option_machine ALTER: department_id -> pivot_dept_cate_branches (forward dependency, option_machine created elsewhere)